# cli/lo/demo/program.ocean
#
# THE CANONICAL DEMO PROGRAM.
#
# Read aloud once at the start of the live demo, then pinned to the top
# pane of the TUI for every corpus in the gauntlet. Not one byte changes
# between corpora. Each corpus is normalized to a temporary `corpus.ndjson`
# with three fields: `id`, `text`, `label`. The OCEAN program never sees
# the original format on disk.

seed 42

load corpus.ndjson take 500 records balanced by label label field is label
embed text into 128 dimensions using tf-idf
cluster for 16 rounds max 24 modules energy = corpus mean using kmeans
align modules using 50 nearest records fine label field is label
find dispersion of each label
save to result.json
